      "version": "0.1.1",
      "notes": "The first release:\n\n- Neo Geo Pocket Color and Neo Geo Pocket games (`.ngc` and `.ngp`) from the card, with NeoPop.\n- The ColecoVision controller or a USB pad on a powered hub.\n- A game's saves go in a `.ngf` file next to the game.\n- When a game is too busy for the cart, fewer pictures are shown so the game keeps its speed. Big Bang Pro Wrestling still runs slower.\n- Sampled sounds don't play yet."
    }
